msgid "Triton算子开发指南"
msgstr "Triton Operator Development Guide"

msgid "概述：本文着重介绍了在NPU上进行Triton算子开发中值得注意的问题，分为三个方面：多核任务并行、单核数据搬运、单核数据运算。首先在多核任务并行中介绍了设置最大硬件核数的依据以及具体的实现。然后在单核数据搬运中具体描述了如何设置合适的循环内数据分块大小，并且介绍了过程中常用的优化手段，还补充了可能面临的UB OVERFLOW问题的处理方式。最后回归单个算子，在单核数据运算层面着重介绍了如何开发Triton算子，并强调了相关的关键点。"
msgstr "Overview: This article highlights noteworthy issues in developing Triton operators on the NPU. It covers three aspects: multi-core task parallelism, single-core data movement, and single-core data computation. First, the multi-core task parallelism section introduces the basis for setting the maximum number of hardware cores and the specific implementation. Then, the single-core data movement section describes how to set an appropriate intra-loop data block size. It also introduces commonly used optimization methods and explains how to handle potential UB OVERFLOW issues. Finally, focusing on a single operator, the single-core data computation section highlights how to develop Triton operators and emphasizes related key points."

msgid "文档组织"
msgstr "Document organization"

msgid "本指南将通用开发原则和按硬件执行单元划分的算子开发路径分开组织："
msgstr "This guide organizes general development principles and operator development paths divided by hardware execution units separately:"

msgid "本页介绍所有 Triton-Ascend 算子都需要关注的通用问题，包括分核、片上内存、访存、Tiling 和 Autotune。"
msgstr "This page describes general concepts that apply to all Triton-Ascend operators, including core partitioning, on-chip memory, memory access, tiling, and autotune."

msgid "[Vector 算子开发](./vector_operator.md) 介绍主要由 Vector Core 执行的逐元素、归约、Gather/Scatter 等算子。"
msgstr "[Vector Operator Development](./vector_operator.md) introduces element-wise, reduction, Gather/Scatter, and other operators that are mainly executed by the Vector Core."

msgid "[Cube 算子开发](./cube_operator.md) 介绍以 `tl.dot`、矩阵乘、批量矩阵乘为核心的算子。"
msgstr "[Cube Operator Development](./cube_operator.md) introduces operators centered on `tl.dot`, matrix multiplication, and batch matrix multiplication."

msgid "[CV 融合算子开发](./cv_fusion_operator.md) 介绍同一个算子中同时存在 Cube 计算和 Vector 后处理、归约、Softmax 或跨核协同的场景。"
msgstr "[CV Fusion Operator Development](./cv_fusion_operator.md) introduces scenarios where Cube computation and Vector post-processing, reduction, Softmax, or cross-core collaboration exist simultaneously in the same operator."

msgid "简单算子优先参考本仓 `docs/zh/examples/` 和 `third_party/ascend/tutorials/`；复杂算子优先参考 GitHub 上的 [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) 中 `tutorial/best_practice/` 的完整优化案例。"
msgstr "For simple operators, refer to `docs/zh/examples/` and `third_party/ascend/tutorials/` in this repository first; for complex operators, refer to the complete optimization cases in `tutorial/best_practice/` under [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) on GitHub first."

msgid "通用多核任务并行"
msgstr "General multi-core task parallelism"

msgid "设置最大硬件核数"
msgstr "Set the maximum number of hardware cores"

msgid "在一个Triton算子中，通常使用grid进行分核操作。对于GPU而言，其计算核心SM通常是几十到几百量级。但是对于昇腾NPU平台而言，其计算核心AI Core的数量在几十个的量级。 虽然运行时接口允许下发并发任务数最大为65535，但超过物理核数的部分是通过新一轮的下发来完成的。如果直接将GPU上的Triton算子拿到昇腾平台上运行，这些大量的任务会引入可观的核启动和核初始化时的额外开销，影响到算子性能表现。 因此，需要针对昇腾平台特性修改分核逻辑。最推荐的做法是**将分核的数量直接固定为硬件的物理核数**，在核内做更为细致的数据分块："
msgstr "In a Triton operator, the grid is typically used for core partitioning. For GPUs, the number of compute cores (SMs) is typically in the tens to hundreds. However, for the Ascend NPU platform, the number of compute cores (AI Cores) is in the tens. Although the runtime API allows dispatching up to 65535 concurrent tasks, the tasks exceeding the number of physical cores are completed through a new round of dispatch. If you directly run Triton operators from the GPU on the Ascend platform, these massive tasks introduce considerable overhead during core startup and initialization, affecting operator performance. Therefore, you need to modify the core partitioning logic based on the characteristics of the Ascend platform. The most recommended practice is to **directly fix the number of core partitions to the number of physical hardware cores**, and perform more detailed data blocking within the core:"

msgid ""
"<br />\n"
msgstr ""
"<br />\n"

msgid ""
"\\\\\n"
msgstr ""
"\\\\\n"

msgid "对于纯Vector算子，分核数等于**Vector核数量**。"
msgstr "For pure Vector operators, the number of split cores equals **the number of Vector cores**."

msgid "对于CV融合算子，分核数等于**Cube核数量**（通常为Vector核数量的一半），算子执行时会按1：2的比例调用Vector核。"
msgstr "For CV fusion operators, the number of split cores equals the **number of Cube cores** (usually half the number of Vector cores). During execution, the operator calls Vector cores at a 1:2 ratio."

msgid "一般而言，在NPU卡上，一个计算核心AI Core含有一个Cube核，每个Cube核配有两个Vector核，因此可以通过以下接口获取**Vector核数(vectorcore_num)**与**Cube核数量(aicore_num)**："
msgstr "Generally, on an NPU card, a compute core, AI Core, contains one Cube core, and each Cube core is paired with two Vector cores. Therefore, you can obtain the **number of Vector cores (vectorcore_num)** and the **number of Cube cores (aicore_num)** through the following interfaces:"

msgid ""
"import torch\n"
"import triton.runtime.driver as driver\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"\n"
"device = torch_npu.npu.current_device()\n"
"properties = driver.active.utils.get_device_properties(device)\n"
"vectorcore_num = properties[\"num_vectorcore\"]\n"
"aicore_num = properties[\"num_aicore\"]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"import torch\n"
"import triton.runtime.driver as driver\n"
"import torch_npu\n"
"\n"
"device = torch_npu.npu.current_device()\n"
"properties = driver.active.utils.get_device_properties(device)\n"
"vectorcore_num = properties[\"num_vectorcore\"]\n"
"aicore_num = properties[\"num_aicore\"]\n"
"\n"

msgid "参考示例代码，先固定核数，再通过内部循环分批处理任务分块："
msgstr "Refer to the sample code: first fix the number of cores, and then process task blocks in batches through an internal loop:"

msgid ""
"NUM_CORE = vectorcore_num\n"
"grid = (NUM_CORE ,)\n"
"_attn_fwd[grid](Q, K, V, M, Out, acc, scale, ...)\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def _attn_fwd(Q, K, V, M, Out, acc, scale,\n"
"              ...,\n"
"              stride_qz, stride_qh,\n"
"              Z: tl.constexpr, H: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              N_CTX: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              HEAD_DIM: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              STAGE: tl.constexpr\n"
"              ):\n"
"    # 计算任务总量,将三维任务(Z,H,M)展平为一维总任务数\n"
"    NUM_BLOCKS_M = N_CTX // BLOCK_M\n"
"    NUM_BLOCKS = NUM_BLOCKS_M * Z * H\n"
"\n"
"    # 每个核根据自己标识选取要处理的任务\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)  # 当前核的唯一ID\n"
"    NUM_CORE = tl.num_programs(0)  # 获取固定启动的总核数\n"
"    # 循环规则：range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, NUM_CORE) 实现\"跨步分配任务\"\n"
"    # - 起始值pid：每个核从自己的ID开始取任务，避免任务重叠\n"
"    # - 步长NUM_CORE：按总核数跨步，确保任务均匀分配到各个核\n"
"    for block_idx in range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, NUM_CORE):\n"
"        # 计算每次任务的数据偏移\n"
"        # 【核心：一维任务索引反向还原为原始多维索引】\n"
"        # block_idx是展平后的一维任务索引，通过整除/取余拆分回原始维度\n"
"        # 1.拆分Z+H合并轴 & M分块轴：\n"
"        #   - 整除NUM_BLOCKS_M：提取Z+H合并轴的索引（task_hz_idx）\n"
"        #   - 取余NUM_BLOCKS_M：提取M维度的分块索引（task_m_idx）\n"
"        task_hz_idx = block_idx // NUM_BLOCKS_M\n"
"        task_m_idx = block_idx % NUM_BLOCKS_M\n"
"        # 2.拆分Z+H合并轴为原始Z轴和H轴：\n"
"        #   - 整除H：还原Z轴索引（off_z）\n"
"        #   - 取余H：还原H轴索引（off_h）\n"
"        off_z = task_hz_idx // H\n"
"        off_h = task_hz_idx % H\n"
"        # 3.计算数据偏移量：根据还原的Z/H索引，定位Q/K/V张量中对应的数据起始位置\n"
"        qvk_offset = off_z.to(tl.int64) * stride_qz + off_h.to(tl.int64) * stride_qh\n"
msgstr ""
"NUM_CORE = vectorcore_num\n"
"grid = (NUM_CORE ,)\n"
"_attn_fwd[grid](Q, K, V, M, Out, acc, scale, ...)\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def _attn_fwd(Q, K, V, M, Out, acc, scale,\n"
"              ...,\n"
"              stride_qz, stride_qh,\n"
"              Z: tl.constexpr, H: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              N_CTX: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              HEAD_DIM: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              BLOCK_M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              BLOCK_N: tl.constexpr,\n"
"              STAGE: tl.constexpr\n"
"              ):\n"
"    # Calculate the total number of tasks and flatten the 3D tasks (Z, H, M) into a 1D total task count.\n"
"    NUM_BLOCKS_M = N_CTX // BLOCK_M\n"
"    NUM_BLOCKS = NUM_BLOCKS_M * Z * H\n"
"\n"
"    # Each core selects the tasks to process based on its own identifier.\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)  # Unique ID of the current core\n"
"    NUM_CORE = tl.num_programs(0)  # Obtain the total number of cores started\n"
"    # Loop rule: range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, NUM_CORE) implements \"strided task assignment\"\n"
"    # - Start value pid: Each core starts taking tasks from its own ID to avoid task overlap.\n"
"    # - Step size NUM_CORE: Strides by the total number of cores to ensure tasks are evenly distributed across all cores.\n"
"    for block_idx in range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, NUM_CORE):\n"
"        # Calculate the data offset for each task\n"
"        # [Core: Reverse the 1D task index back to the original multi-dimensional index]\n"
"        # block_idx is the flattened 1D task index, which is split back to the original dimensions through division and modulo.\n"
"        # 1. Split the merged Z+H axis and the M block axis:\n"
"        #   - Divide by NUM_BLOCKS_M: Extract the index of the merged Z+H axis (task_hz_idx)\n"
"        #   - Modulo NUM_BLOCKS_M: Extract the block index of the M dimension (task_m_idx)\n"
"        task_hz_idx = block_idx // NUM_BLOCKS_M\n"
"        task_m_idx = block_idx % NUM_BLOCKS_M\n"
"        # 2. Split the merged Z+H axis into the original Z axis and H axis:\n"
"        #   - Divide by H: Restore the Z axis index (off_z)\n"
"        #   - Modulo H: Restore the H axis index (off_h)\n"
"        off_z = task_hz_idx // H\n"
"        off_h = task_hz_idx % H\n"
"        # 3. Calculate the data offset: Locate the corresponding data starting position in the Q/K/V tensors based on the restored Z/H indexes.\n"
"        qvk_offset = off_z.to(tl.int64) * stride_qz + off_h.to(tl.int64) * stride_qh\n"

msgid "通用单核数据搬运"
msgstr "General single-core data movement"

msgid "设置合适的循环内数据分块大小（BLOCK SIZE）"
msgstr "Set an appropriate data block size within the loop (BLOCK SIZE)"

msgid "以add_kernel为例，变量和操作共同决定了片上内存的空间占用大小，通过修改BLOCK_SIZE大小可以调整循环内数据分块和计算中间结果占用的大小。如果超过上限则算子编译时会提示预期占用大小并报错。要达到最大计算访存比，BLOCK_SIZE需要在不超出片上内存的空间时尽可能大，这可以通过Triton-Ascend的[Autotune](../examples/06_autotune_example.md)预先设置不同的BLOCK_SIZE，运行时会自动选取最优设置。"
msgstr "Taking add_kernel as an example, variables and operations together determine the on-chip memory space usage. By modifying the BLOCK_SIZE, you can adjust the data blocking within the loop and the space occupied by intermediate computation results. If the limit is exceeded, the operator compilation prompts the expected memory usage and reports an error. To achieve the maximum compute-to-memory-access ratio, BLOCK_SIZE needs to be as large as possible without exceeding the on-chip memory space. You can pre-set different BLOCK_SIZE values through the Triton-Ascend [Autotune](../examples/06_autotune_example.md), and the optimal setting is automatically selected at runtime."

msgid ""
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr,\n"
"               y_ptr,\n"
"               out_ptr,\n"
"               n,  # 元素总数量。\n"
"               BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr,  # 分块元素数量。\n"
"               ):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    NUM_CORE = tl.num_programs(0)\n"
"    NUM_BLOCKS = tl.cdiv(n, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    for block_idx in range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, NUM_CORE):\n"
"        block_start = block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"        # 分块大小为 BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"        offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"        mask = offsets < n\n"
"        # 加载 x,y 数据到片上内存\n"
"        x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"        y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"\n"
"        output = x + y\n"
"\n"
"        tl.store(out_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)\n"
msgstr ""
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr,\n"
"               y_ptr,\n"
"               out_ptr,\n"
"               n,  # Total number of elements.\n"
"               BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr,  # Number of elements in the block.\n"
"               ):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    NUM_CORE = tl.num_programs(0)\n"
"    NUM_BLOCKS = tl.cdiv(n, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    for block_idx in range(pid, NUM_BLOCKS, NUM_CORE):\n"
"        block_start = block_idx * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"        # The block size is BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"        offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"        mask = offsets < n\n"
"        # Load x and y data to the on-chip memory\n"
"        x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"        y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"\n"
"        output = x + y\n"
"\n"
"        tl.store(out_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)\n"

msgid "保证Tensor尾轴大小对齐"
msgstr "Ensure that the size of the tail axis of the Tensor is aligned."

msgid "【描述】昇腾硬件的UB（Unified Buffer，统一缓冲区）对Tensor的尾轴（最后一个维度）大小有对齐要求：尾轴数据量需为对齐单位的整数倍，若尾轴长度不足，硬件会自动补齐。不同算子类型的对齐要求如下表所示。"
msgstr "[Description] The UB (Unified Buffer) of Ascend hardware has alignment requirements for the size of the last axis (the final dimension) of a tensor: the data size of the last axis must be an integer multiple of the alignment unit. If the length of the last axis is insufficient, the hardware automatically pads it. The following table shows the alignment requirements for different operator types."

msgid "算子类型"
msgstr "Operator type"

msgid "使用的计算单元"
msgstr "Compute unit used"

msgid "尾轴对齐要求"
msgstr "Trailing Axis Alignment Requirements"

msgid "VV类算子（Vector-Vector，纯向量计算类算子）"
msgstr "VV operators (Vector-Vector, pure vector computation operators)"

msgid "仅使用Vector核"
msgstr "Use only the Vector Core"

msgid "尾轴大小能被32B整除"
msgstr "The tail axis size is evenly divisible by 32B"

msgid "CV类算子（Cube-Vector，Cube核与Vector核融合计算类算子）"
msgstr "CV-type operators (Cube-Vector, operators that fuse Cube core and Vector core computations)"

msgid "使用Cube核+Vector核"
msgstr "Use the Cube core + Vector core"

msgid "尾轴大小能被512B整除"
msgstr "The tail axis size is divisible by 512B"

msgid "【描述】对模型中shape为(2048,3)和(2048,1)Tensor的种种操作，都会因为自动补齐导致性能明显恶化，此时可考虑通过转置操作将对齐轴转到低维，直到store时再转置为原始状态，从而规避自动补齐，优化计算速度。 同时由于转置操作本身也受自动补齐规则的影响，因此同样需要特殊技巧来规避补齐。这里列出一个“借轴转置”的tip，适用于**tensor.numel() % 256Byte == 0**的场景，具体操作如下："
msgstr "[Description] Various operations on tensors with shapes (2048,3) and (2048,1) in the model all suffer significant performance degradation due to automatic padding. In this case, consider transposing the alignment axis to a lower dimension, and then transposing back to the original state when storing. This avoids automatic padding and optimizes computation speed. Since transpose operations themselves are also affected by automatic padding rules, special techniques are also needed to avoid padding. Here is a tip for \"axis-borrowing transpose\" that applies to scenarios where **tensor.numel() % 256Byte == 0**. The specific operations are as follows:"

msgid "注：VV类算子表示该类算子在运算过程中只使用了Vector Core；CV类算子表示该类算子运算过程中既使用了AI Core又使用了Vector Core。"
msgstr "Note: VV operators use only the Vector Core during computation; CV operators use both the AI Core and the Vector Core during computation."

msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

msgid ""
"# conv_state = tensor([2048, 3], bfloat16)\n"
"conv_state = tl.load(conv_state_ptr + conv_batch_offs * conv_batch_stride + doffs * 3 + tl.arange(0, 2048 * 3)) # 当成1D tensor load，此时由于numel对齐，不会自动补齐。\n"
"conv_state_T = conv_state.reshape(128, 16 * 3).transpose().reshape(16, 3 * 128).transpose().reshape(3 * 2048,) # 长轴(2048)裂出一根对齐轴(16)借给短轴(3)，从而让两个轴都对齐\n"
msgstr ""
"# conv_state = tensor([2048, 3], bfloat16)\n"
"conv_state = tl.load(conv_state_ptr + conv_batch_offs * conv_batch_stride + doffs * 3 + tl.arange(0, 2048 * 3)) # Load as a 1D tensor. Because numel is aligned, no automatic padding is performed.\n"
"conv_state_T = conv_state.reshape(128, 16 * 3).transpose().reshape(16, 3 * 128).transpose().reshape(3 * 2048,) # The long axis (2048) splits out an alignment axis (16) to lend to the short axis (3), so that both axes are aligned.\n"

msgid "先将数据搬运到UB上，再从UB中select目标值"
msgstr "First, move the data to the UB, and then select the target value from the UB."

msgid "【描述】在NPU的离散场景下，可以先将数据搬运到UB，再从shared中select目标值。"
msgstr "[Description] In discrete scenarios on the NPU, you can first move the data to the UB, and then select the target value from shared."

msgid ""
"@triton.jit\n"
"def pick_kernel(\n"
"        x_ptr,\n"
"        idx_ptr,\n"
"        y_ptr,\n"
"        stride_x,\n"
"        stride_idx,\n"
"        stride_y,\n"
"        M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"        N: tl.constexpr\n"
"):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    rn = tl.arange(0, N)\n"
"\n"
"    idx = tl.load(idx_ptr + rn * stride_idx)\n"
"    mask = idx < M\n"
"\n"
"    # 原先写法\n"
"    # val = tl.load(x_ptr + idx * stride_x, mask=mask)\n"
"    # 修改后写法\n"
"    rm = tl.arange(0, M)\n"
"    x_shared = tl.load(x_ptr + rm * stride_x)  # [M]\n"
"    val = tl.gather(x_shared, idx, 0)\n"
"\n"
"    tl.store(y_ptr + rn * stride_y, val, mask=mask)\n"
msgstr ""
"@triton.jit\n"
"def pick_kernel(\n"
"        x_ptr,\n"
"        idx_ptr,\n"
"        y_ptr,\n"
"        stride_x,\n"
"        stride_idx,\n"
"        stride_y,\n"
"        M: tl.constexpr,\n"
"        N: tl.constexpr\n"
"):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(0)\n"
"    rn = tl.arange(0, N)\n"
"\n"
"    idx = tl.load(idx_ptr + rn * stride_idx)\n"
"    mask = idx < M\n"
"\n"
"    # Original approach\n"
"    # val = tl.load(x_ptr + idx * stride_x, mask=mask)\n"
"    # Modified approach\n"
"    rm = tl.arange(0, M)\n"
"    x_shared = tl.load(x_ptr + rm * stride_x)  # [M]\n"
"    val = tl.gather(x_shared, idx, 0)\n"
"\n"
"    tl.store(y_ptr + rn * stride_y, val, mask=mask)\n"

msgid "优化前后性能分析和对比"
msgstr "Performance analysis and comparison before and after optimization"

msgid "通过msprof工具执行用例可得到PROF_*文件夹，里面包含了op_summary_\\*.csv文件，该文件可以帮助分析流水情况。注：“\\*”表示时间戳，[性能数据采集参考方法](../debug_guide/profiling.md)。"
